; Save Game correction:
;   The local input fetch at $CD:D33F masked with #$DF00 before the cancel test,
;   which discarded logical-A bit $0080 (physical B after the global A/B swap).
;   Replace that mask with #$9F80: retain physical-A/select ($8000), Start and
